# 🔬 Breast Cancer Analysis – EDA + ML + DL

## 📌 Project Overview
Complete analysis of the Breast Cancer Wisconsin dataset
using Exploratory Data Analysis, Machine Learning, and Deep Learning.

## 📊 Dataset
- Source   : UCI / Sklearn breast cancer dataset
- Samples  : 569
- Features : 30
- Target   : Malignant (M) or Benign (B)

## 🔍 What's Covered
### 1. EDA
- Head, Tail, Describe, Info
- Missing value check
- Univariate, Bivariate, Multivariate analysis
- Correlation Heatmap, Pairplot, Boxplots

### 2. Preprocessing
- Handled missing values (Unnamed: 32 column)
- StandardScaler for feature scaling
- Train/Test Split (80/20) with stratify

### 3. Machine Learning Models
| Model | Accuracy |
|---|---|
| Tuned MLP | 99.12% |
| Tuned LR | 98.24% |
| Tuned SVM | 97.37% |
| Tuned RF | 97.37% |
| KNN | 95.61% |
| Decision Tree | 92.98% |

### 4. Deep Learning (TensorFlow/Keras)
- 4 Hidden Layers (256 → 128 → 64 → 32)
- BatchNormalization + Dropout
- EarlyStopping + ReduceLROnPlateau
- Test Accuracy: 98.25%

## 🛠️ Libraries Used
- pandas, numpy, matplotlib, seaborn
- scikit-learn
- tensorflow / keras

## 🏆 Best Model
Tuned MLPClassifier → 99.12% accuracy

